---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import mark from "../assets/brand/kns-mark.png";
---
<Base title="About the Studio" description="Kuro Neko Sama Studios is a small indie studio making games and books: Heroes of Lumora, Aldenexia: Lightfall and Zen Divers.">
  <div class="wrap page-hero about">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>A small studio with a big world.</h1>
      <p>Kuro Neko Sama Studios is Ross's indie game and book studio. We design and code the games ourselves in Godot, and Ross writes the books.</p>
    </div>
    <Image src={mark} alt="Kuro Neko Sama Studios cat mark" width={260} />
  </div>
  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>A world that started at fifteen</h2>
      <p>The world of Aldenexia began when Ross, who founded the studio, was about fifteen, inspired by D&amp;D computer games like Pool of Radiance and the Ultima series. The goal was always to bring that world to life, so other people could walk around in it too.</p>
      <p>Then EverQuest came along and showed what that could feel like: a world so big and so alive that it pulled you in and didn't let go. That's the bar we're reaching for.</p>
      <p>Heroes of Lumora and Aldenexia: Lightfall are both steps toward it. Heroes is the fast one: a fantasy bullet-hell set in the town of Lumora that you can finish in an evening and keep coming back to. Aldenexia is the long one: a multiplayer RPG about exploring that world and living with your choices. They share a home, and some of the same people.</p>
      <h2>The books</h2>
      <p><a href="/books/"><em>Zen Divers</em></a> grew out of Ross's years of teaching scuba, and <em>The Lost Art of Being an Asshole</em> is about truth and Stoicism in modern life. Both are out on Amazon.</p>
      <p>We used to publish under two names, Kuro Neko Sama Games and KNS Books. As of late 2026 it's all one: Kuro Neko Sama Studios.</p>
      <div class="btns"><a class="btn primary" href="/games/">See the games</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact/">Say hello</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 40px; align-items: center; text-align: left; }
  .about p { margin-left: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .about :global(img) { width: 160px; } }
</style>
